    * What others took next : Later
  step Decide
    * A page for each course : Pilot
    * A first lesson free : Term one
activity Enrol
  step Sign up
    * With an email address : Pilot
    * With the school's account : Term one
  step Pay
    * By card : Term one
    * As a group : Later
